{"id":"4e5a25c93496ad88","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-regular-point.md","title":"Regular Point","display":"df-regular-point — Regular Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-regular-point","aliases":["58-df-regular-point"],"display":"df-regular-point — Regular Point","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","[[./58-df-differential-between-manifolds.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-surjective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-regular-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-regular-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-regular-point — Regular Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"becb68cbe0f3a15e\" href=\"?note=becb68cbe0f3a15e\" title=\"./58-df-differential-between-manifolds.md\">58-df-differential-between-manifolds.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cd9981d8428c2629\" href=\"?note=cd9981d8428c2629\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f8cb046321ba311\" href=\"?note=9f8cb046321ba311\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md\">../batch05/58-df-surjective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,f,p,L\\in V\">\\(M,N,f,p,L\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DifferentialBetween}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{DifferentialBetween}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"becb68cbe0f3a15e\" href=\"?note=becb68cbe0f3a15e\" title=\"./58-df-differential-between-manifolds.md\">58-df-differential-between-manifolds.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cd9981d8428c2629\" href=\"?note=cd9981d8428c2629\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Surjective}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Surjective}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9f8cb046321ba311\" href=\"?note=9f8cb046321ba311\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md\">../batch05/58-df-surjective.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularPoint}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularPoint}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}point} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularPoint}_S(p,f,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\land p\\in M\\land\n\\exists T_M,T_N,L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T_M,M,p)\\land\n\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T_N,N,f(p))\\land\n\\mathrm{DifferentialBetween}_S(L,f,p,M,N)\\land\n\\mathrm{Surjective}(L,T_M,T_N)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}point} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularPoint}_S(p,f,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\land p\\in M\\land\n\\exists T_M,T_N,L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T_M,M,p)\\land\n\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T_N,N,f(p))\\land\n\\mathrm{DifferentialBetween}_S(L,f,p,M,N)\\land\n\\mathrm{Surjective}(L,T_M,T_N)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A regular point has surjective differential.</li>\n<li>Both tangent carriers and both manifolds now belong to the formal signature of the differential call.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-differential-between-manifolds.md","status":"resolved","id":"becb68cbe0f3a15e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-differential-between-manifolds.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"cd9981d8428c2629","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f8cb046321ba311","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-surjective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-differential-between-manifolds.md","status":